      "id": "mineru-filter1-volume3-5-5-1",
      "topic": "deadlock",
      "kind": "pyq",
      "type": "nat",
      "marks": 1,
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "year": 2018,
      "text": "Consider a system with 3 processes that share 4 instances of the same resource type. Each process can request a maximum of K instances. Resources can be requested and releases only one at a time. The largest value of K that will always avoid deadlock is \\_\\_\\_\\_",
      "options": [],
