      "type": "mcq",
      "marks": 2,
      "difficulty": "medium",
      "text": "Consider allocation of memory to a new process. Assume that none of the existing holes in the memory will exactly fit the process's memory requirement. Hence, a new hole of smaller size will be created if allocation is made in any of the existing holes. Which one of the following statement is TRUE?",
