      "text": "Let $m[0] \\ldots m[4]$ be mutexes (binary semaphores) and $P[0] \\ldots P[4]$ be processes. Suppose each process $P[i]$ executes the following: wait (m[i]); wait (m(i+1) mod 4]); release (m[i]); release (m(i+1) mod 4]); This could cause",
