      "marks": 2,
      "difficulty": "medium",
      "year": 2010,
      "text": "Consider the methods used by processes P1 and P2 for accessing their critical sections whenever needed, as given below. The initial values of shared boolean variables S1 and S2 are randomly assigned. | Method used by P1 | Method used by P2\n| while (S1 == S2);Critical SectionS1 = S2; | while (S1 != S2);Critical SectionS2 = not(S1); Which one of the following statements describes the properties achieved?",
      "options": [
