      "marks": 2,
      "difficulty": "medium",
      "year": 2010,
      "text": "The following program consists of 3 concurrent processes and 3 binary semaphores. The semaphores are initialized as $S0 = 1$, $S1 = 0$ and $S2 = 0$. | Process P0 | Process P1 | Process P2\n| while (true) { wait (S0); print ‘0’; release (S1); release (S2); } | wait (S1); release (S0); | wait (S2); release (S0); How many times will process P0 print '0'?",
