      "text": "A computer system uses the Banker's Algorithm to deal with deadlocks. Its current state is shown in the table below, where P0, P1, P2 are processes, and R0, R1, R2 are resources types. Maximum Need | | R0 | R1 | R2\n| P0 | 4 | 1 | 2\n| P1 | 1 | 5 | 1\n| P2 | 1 | 2 | 3 Current Allocation | | R0 | R1 | R2\n| P0 | 1 | 0 | 2\n| P1 | 0 | 3 | 1\n| P2 | 1 | 0 | 2 Available | R0 | R1 | R2\n| 2 | 2 | 0",
